\paragraph{LLM gold evaluation.}
On the gold set, LLM few-shot-CoT achieves 0.910 macro-F1, surpassing structural GB (0.839) by 7.1\,pp---reversing the silver-label ranking where structural methods led.
However, the same configuration collapses on cross-agent OH transfer (0.491; \S\ref{sec:cross_agent}), yielding a $-$47.6\,pp gap vs.\ structural GB (0.967), at ${\sim}$\$40 per evaluation vs.\ ${<}$\$0.01 for structural features.

